{
  "slug": "sap-ux-fiori-tools",
  "name": "Sap Fiori Mcp Server",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP server and skills for SAP Fiori development. Build, modify, and test SAP Fiori Elements applications with AI assistance.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `sap-fiori-add-visual-filter` (Add visual filters (chart-based) to SAP Fiori Elements filter bar/value help using CAP or ABAP RAP), `sap-fiori-analytical-chart` (Add analytical chart (chart + table hybrid) to SAP Fiori Elements List Report using aggregated data), `sap-fiori-app-development` (Guidelines for SAP Fiori app development for CAP and standalone projects), `sap-fiori-create-cli` (Run, invoke, and test the @sap-ux/create CLI — generate, add, convert, remove, update, change, list, get commands for…), `sap-fiori-eslint-plugin` (Configure, migrate, or run ESLint with @sap-ux/eslint-plugin-fiori-tools in SAP Fiori projects (standalone or CAP)), `sap-fiori-opa5-test-development` (Use this skill when writing, fixing, extending, or reviewing OPA5 integration tests for SAP Fiori Elements applications -…), `sap-fiori-tree-table` (Configure hierarchical tree table to SAP Fiori elements application for displaying parent-child recursive hierarchies)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `fiori-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sap-fiori-mcp-server@claude-plugins-official` from `SAP/open-ux-tools` (`packages/fiori-mcp-server`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
